body:
The first device rode on your belt through the whole fight, humming, and did exactly one thing: at the worst moment of it, when everything was going badly, it went perfectly still, and so did your hand. Then it got very hot.

{trial_outcome}

Bram's Sending arrives before you have finished bandaging. 'Report. Everything. Start with what surprised you.'

{shadow}

The second device is a small brass box with a dial and no instructions. During the fight it clicked, once, each time you were about to make a mistake, half a breath before you made it. Twice you listened.

{trial_outcome}

Bram's Sending finds you after. 'Report. What did the box do?'

{shadow}
